Datawiz Store Manager allows easily analyze shop’s main metrics on your phone. Application shows data of problem products.
You can make all decisions based on real data and determine shops problems with Datawiz Store Manager. All reports and metrics are updates everyday.

Main opportunities with Datawiz Store Manager :
- Monitor your main metrics in real time;
- Quick access to all your data from anywhere at anytime;
- Understandable data via dynamic visualisations and metrics;
- Analyze promotion products and POS-terminal capacity;
- Group the problem products by reason;
- Easy access to dashboards created by Datawiz Builder.
